{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1416728-how-do-you-create-a-talisman","id":1416728,"title":"How do you create a talisman","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-10-04T08:05:26-07:00","id":1416728,"title":"How do you create a talisman","content":"So I'm in a multi-splat group, and I want to be able to make some talismans for my non-mages to use. Does anyone know how to make talismans?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26433-ascentionthemage","name":"AscentionTheMage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26433_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-04T10:56:36-07:00","id":1416741,"title":"","content":"In general, Talismans are crafted using the requirements detailed in M20 core.<br /> <br /> The Book of Secrets has a more detailed Wonder creation system covering all types of Wonders.<br /> <br /> Basically you need: Prime 4, the Spheres for whatever it will do, a lot of Quintessence (and I mean a lot), and be ready to pay a permanent WP dot (which will cost XP to replace).<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-04T12:17:44-07:00","id":1416748,"title":"","content":"You'll also want to make sure that Q